  [(1557, Shadow7.e0P (s+15) + 3), (1558, Shadow7.e0P (s+15) + 4), (Shadow7.e0P s + 5, Shadow7.e0P (s+15) + 5),
   (Shadow7.e0P s + 3, Shadow7.e0P (s+15) + 6), (Shadow7.e0P s + 7, Shadow7.e0P (s+15) + 7), (Shadow7.e0P s + 6, Shadow7.e0P (s+15) + 8)]

